<title>BELGIUM: EU sets standing refunds for rice.</title>
<headline>EU sets standing refunds for rice.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals and rice management committee set standing export refunds for rice for April, an EU member state official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The committee set the following refunds on Thursday, in Ecus per tonne, with effect from April 1 -</p>
<p>    small packs to the Mediterranean     261</p>
<p>    small packs to further destinations  266</p>
<p>    husked rice to Switzerland	     204</p>
<p>    semi-blanched				204</p>
<p>    white					  255</p>
</text>
